### 1. Book and Pay ile bilet oluştur
POST https://localhost:5000/api/flights/book-and-pay
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "TEST123",
  "departureAirportCode": "IST",
  "destinationAirportCode": "JFK",
  "departureTime": "2024-12-25T10:00:00",
  "estimatedArrivalTime": "2024-12-25T18:00:00",
  "price": 100.00,
  "airlineCode": "TK",
  "userEmail": "test@example.com"
}

### Response:
# {
#   "ticketId": 123,
#   "paymentUrl": "https://checkout.stripe.com/..."
# }

###

### 2. Ticket durumunu kontrol et (ticketId'yi yukarıdan alın)
GET https://localhost:5000/api/payment/check-ticket/123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Response beklenen:
# {
#   "ticketId": 123,
#   "isPaid": false,  <-- Ödeme öncesi false olmalı
#   "pnrCode": null,
#   "price": 100.00
# }

###

### 3. (ÖDEMEYİ YAPTIN SONRA) - Tekrar kontrol et
GET https://localhost:5000/api/payment/check-ticket/123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Response beklenen:
# {
#   "ticketId": 123,
#   "isPaid": true,   <-- Ödeme sonrası true olmalı
#   "pnrCode": "ABC12345"
# }

###

### 4. (Eğer hala false ise) Manuel olarak işaretle (sadece test için)
POST https://localhost:5000/api/payment/test-mark-paid/123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Response:
# {
#   "message": "Ticket marked as paid successfully",
#   "ticketId": 123,
#   "isPaid": true,
#   "pnrCode": "XYZ12345"
# }
